@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About Us";
}

<section class="container py-5">
    <h1 class="kfp-section-title">About KFP</h1>
    <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <p>KFP — <strong>Kentucky Fried Pork</strong> — started as a single roadside stand with one recipe and a big appetite for crispy, juicy fried pork. Today we serve buckets, combos, and sandwiches to hungry folks everywhere (well, in this demo, anyway).</p>
            <p>This site is a parody / portfolio project built to demonstrate a full ASP.NET Core MVC web application: user accounts, a browsable menu backed by a SQL database, a shopping cart, checkout, and order history.</p>
            <p class="text-muted small">Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to any real fried chicken restaurant chain. All resemblance is intentional parody, for demonstration purposes only.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6 text-center">
            <span style="font-size: 8rem;">🍗🪣🥓</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
